  dialogueGroupName: Merchant Bob
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9fcb612a6a3007e428ea982ca9030cd3, type: 2}
  textLine:
  - If this takes longer than a pint, i`m busy.
  - Ah, good to see an old friend - though yer barley outta diapers. What can I get
    ye?
  - Joe took me tools again, I swear, I`ll bury that bastard...
  - If ye brake it, you buy it. If I break it... well, that`s a tradition.
